      "research_entry": "On the complete 3 by 3 pairing fibre, unit row and column margins and unit cell capacities give exactly six permutation tables. Every cell belongs to one even and one odd vertex of the incidence graph K3,3. Thus attainable integer linear observation lists have equal even and odd totals, with no further congruence. Compare parity observability for different coefficient groups and classify the residual under two specified future exit relabelings. Can test all six states, all future-equivalence classes and minimum nontrivial readout alphabets.",
